  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/R0jPMkz/title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"760\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/F4XvqzY/d.png\" width=\"409\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><em>有什麼不對勁。<br>你的意識中有些部分已經遺失了。<br>世界似乎正逐漸從你手中溜走。<br>你看到了幻象。<br>恐怖的景象。<br>它們傷害了你，且感覺無比真實。<br>所有感官體驗都如此真實，但你知道這並非事實。<br>還是說，這就是現實？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><em>歡迎來到 Minechosis。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/D1zmc2z/nm.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"69\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>碾壓者</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">- 棲息於主世界森林地區 -</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">- 能鑽入僅有半格的狹窄空間 -</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">- 會破壞窗戶並成群出現 -</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">- 略具危險性 -</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">（尚未實裝）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>喧囂者</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">- 出沒於主世界森林周邊 -<br>- 會破壞阻擋其行進路徑的特定方塊 -<br>- 極度危險，毫不留情 -</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（已於 ALPHA&nbsp;v0.1.0 版本實裝）</span></span>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>擴張者</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">- 棲息於地獄森林周邊 -<br>- 將玩家封入極度危險的恍惚狀態中 -<br>- 中度危險 -</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">（尚未實裝）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>遊魂</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">- 棲息於地獄靈魂沙谷地 -<br>- 漂浮在空中並鎖定附近的玩家 -<br>- 令人困擾的危險 -</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">（尚未實裝）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qMs21YW/ki.png\" width=\"433\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">會自然生成，因此遭遇頻率可能不太平衡。<br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>- 可能不會修復 -</strong></span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">攀爬與爬行功能無法運作（部分生物本身未設計此動作）<br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>- 不會修復 -</strong></span><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">請於問題追蹤器回報任何潛在問題。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NnDmJms/stm.png\" width=\"533\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">未來我會在此處補充更多內容。目前先盡情享受吧 :)</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6YTGn6n/mr.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0ZWCYwD/gl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"35\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/gczs-horror-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6B0hDhg/ghps.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"35\"></a><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><strong>（包含 Minechosis 的替代自訂整合包）</strong></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jn2HhgqxaF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2vgTkPV/Discord-Invite-Poster.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"508\" height=\"175\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=787\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PZVrMGnp/Kinetic-Hosting-2025-Large-Banner.png\" width=\"570\" height=\"200\"></a></p>",
